version: 1
title: Illustrative Transformer encoder
summary: A fictional encoder example for exploring the reference-inspired
  presentation style. The encoder stack is repeated six times.
instructions: Show sublayer-level detail, residual connections, and a frame
  around the six-layer encoder stack.
